{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Alright. I thought we'd need to go to the stone in Hampstead. What should we tell others in the park about this? They'll definitely ask us about all this.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:15:37.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868194660496056340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Tell them that you are helpnig me with a task I cannot do myself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:16:19.227000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868194836187058216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"the mender heads out to <#861700807626588220> with fuddles and roy","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:16:39.672000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868194921939632128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"https://youtu.be/V4lr-npnvqM","created_at":"2021-07-23T18:37:08.375000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868200075493523486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"The Mender enters the cottage and begins writing a note:\n```So as you know, we have put in place a stone here in The City.  I think our next target is Kingsbridge as it needs stability.  I also believe its a fools errand to bring back the Ravens, I have seen first hand how badly a suicide mission can be on those that survive the loss.  Even if the Ravens do come back, we don't know what the price will be.  So instead let us focus on what we can do to bring strength and stability to Kingsbridge.  I would like you to start scouting out the area to find the Heart of that town.  Keep in mind, a heart can be black with misuse and even decay.  So be sure to look past what is, and see what should be to find the heart.\n\nAlso make sure to check in here a few times a day if you can, and leave notes, in case our times don't match up.```","created_at":"2021-07-26T14:51:06.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869230357239705690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Ben Franklin reads the note.","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:28:00.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869254740104601661","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"My dearest Mender.\nSome would say fixing broken cornerstones is a fools errand too. But they are as necessary to the city as you or I. A mission that succeeds but has losses is not suicide. It is battle, and a victorious one at that. One so acquainted with life after death ought to see that life is a necessary choice, even when marred by unpleasantness. \n\nAs a mason, I would implore you to instruct your menders to consider with care the words given to kingsbridge. Do not attempt to solve it's immediate problems. Rather give it wisdom to bring it's nature in line with the path EC ought to go.","created_at":"2021-07-26T16:36:07.838000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T16:38:21.447000Z","id":"869256786190929990","reply_to_id":"869230357239705690","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Roy enters the cottage, looking for the note. He finds it, along with the new one, and reads both. Before leaving he conjures 10 fresh bugberries.","created_at":"2021-07-26T17:18:16.753000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869267393229250580","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
