{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Roy leaves a note:\n```\nLikely places where the heart of Kingsbridge could be, based on initial recon looking for what could be the borough's oldest part:\n- Fontaine de Florian - candidate for a symbolic place, a Mason I'm not, but it feels like somewhere that could be called the heart of the borough.\n- Lamplighters' office - apparently contains \"powers and occupants that seem ancient\", and with its utility would fit as analogous to the Gazette.\nCurrent options not investigated up close yet, both of us assisting with preparations for two missions - counterstrike on the Gazette, and the Ravens recovery. New Lamplighters unavailable for the same reason, and might be of help with investigating their office.\nHopefully more results tomorrow. The two missions are difficult, but I choose to believe in our allies.\n--Roy```","created_at":"2021-07-27T18:18:12.674000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869644863480676372","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Roy leaves the cottage.","created_at":"2021-07-27T18:18:42.502000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869644988588367922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"The mender looks at the notes once again, not removing them.\n```First off Welcome our new members.  Roy will be in charge of giving you details as he was my first Mender, he knows more about my intentions than anyone else.  With that said, there is one more I would like to talk to: Eldon.\n\nSecondly, I talked to the Ravens yesterday.  I realized that Kingsbridge is their domain, and I wanted them to have the option of setting their town on its best path.  I can not set the stone of Kingsbridge until the Umbral Cup is cleansed.\n\nI may have more news soon.```","created_at":"2021-07-29T15:53:03.462000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870333110129143869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Alright, welcome to the cottage. Oh, hey, there's a new note.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:31:18.407000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870372934814941194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Hmm, notes, huh? Might be useful for me to just send Kukudh in to leave them sometimes.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:31:54.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870373084652240926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yeah, usually when the schedules don't align, we're leaving notes. Including the instructions for the cipher, they're over there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:33:04.117000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870373378194817034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So, not sure how much Mender told you so far, but the deal is: each borough has a cornerstone, and there's one for the whole city in Hampstead. One of those is by the gazette.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:34:18.639000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870373690762735668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Ah, isn't that where we were looking into a second park?'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:34:45.137000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870373801903390720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Ed walks over checking out the notes","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:34:57.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870373853841485874","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Yeah, the second park thing was was a ruse. I was not to tell anyone outside the cottage about anything discussed inside. Well, I still think Hampstead could use a park like this, but that's not the main point.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:35:35.580000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870374013476671508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"These cornerstones are a big deal, what gets written on them carries on to apply to the area around it. If you've been here a few days ago, you might have seen Fuddles make an inscription on Franklin's arcane cube. It's the same thing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:37:00.896000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870374371317923881","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Ah, that makes sense. No wonder we never went to look into it more.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:37:06.529000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870374394944430161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"If you recall me asking around at the Voice 'out of curiosity' for where the oldest part of Kingsbridge could be, that's why - I've been looking into places where that borough's cornerstone could be.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:38:20.226000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870374704052064358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"Ed reads the last note \"did Fuddles mention to you both the meeting with Bo and Bones last night by any chance? \"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:38:42.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870374799216631869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Nope. Bo was originally going to be another one invited to the cottage, but, well, he found a very close friend.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:39:22.087000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870374963515887666","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'A shame. He would have been a good ally.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:40:07.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870375154532880436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"He still is, just not a mender as it stands right now.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:40:42.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870375298829529148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"He might still be able to help somehow\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:40:54.344000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870375350469808168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'I suppose. Just... I have to admit, *he* still scares me.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:41:15.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870375437149298698","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So anyway, what was the meeting with him and Bones about?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:41:24.492000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870375476919685170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"About gathering a group to investigate Umbral Cup and how to cleanse it... you two would be a great asset to that\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:42:35.136000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870375773222109204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"(One sec rechecking the chat last night)","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:43:24.598000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870375980680744960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'That was the pub in Kingsbridge, yes? The, ah... slightly murderous one?'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:43:38.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870376039510065212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I see\". Roy checks the most recent note. \"That would check out. Now that Ravens, priestesses, and lamplighters returned, this should speed things up. So the Cup would be the next target.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:44:43.872000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870376313180008529","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'So if we're available when a raid on it is being planned, we should definitely help out. Ed, what do you know about that place? Even if we aren't able to actively join the fight, we can make some supplies.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:46:19.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870376713891217439","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Well I know that place has been linked to murders and we were put to sleep and paralized. Woke up chained to a wall in the basement... it was only through Apgan and I believe Nolan that we were able to get out. Have you two heard about either Violet or the mothman?","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:50:05.330000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870377661472575508","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Heard stories about a mothman, but that's it. So, if possible, we must make sure we can't get put to sleep against our will.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:51:01.090000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870377895346974801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Hmm. See, this is a case where my old body would have been useful.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:51:32.126000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870378025521393734","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Probably.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:51:49.563000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870378098657472602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Kukudh is busy - they're communicating to me, I'm just not responding while in here - but I can have them ask around later, in case anyone knows any potions which may help.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:52:48.784000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870378347048337418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Alright, so I suppose we have our immediate goal - at some point we'll need to solve the problem of the Umbral Cup, if we don't want the Noir getting out of control. Even more than it is now, that is. And if we come by Eldon, we should direct him to meet with Mender. Is there anything else we need to clarify before joining Eliza in Feytown?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:54:23.255000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870378743288430623","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"I don't think so\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:55:54.504000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870379126014484500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
