{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Should we ask the lamplighters for help in this as well?\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:57:39.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870379565674020866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Sonny will definitely be helpful, I hear elves can't be put to sleep. And lamplighters, well, the thing is: we need to keep the details of everything discussed here within the cottage. At most, encrypting our messages outside. We can let them know Bo and Bones want to take care of the Cup with us, but the part about Kingsbridge's cornerstone stays secret for now.\"\nRoy pauses for a moment.\n\"There is a being in the Noir, that calls itself 'Hope'. Apparently some people have met it, and that includes Apgan, and probably some other lamplighters. Hope has told a few people about the need to find and restore the cornerstones, but unless Mender managed to, we haven't had contact with it to make 100% sure they're an ally. In short, they know that there is a cornerstone in Hampstead, but that's it. It should stay that way for now. The Cup has nothing to do with it outside the cottage.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T19:01:41.673000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870380582146826290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Got it. The Cup being, ah, nightmarish is public knowledge, at least, so us offering to help should be seen as normal.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T19:03:37.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870381066106576936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'Also - I'll have them leave a note here about it, but if any of us happen to need them, Kukudh should be happy to assist, even if I'm asleep.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T19:05:50.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870381625710624778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"'I'll ask them to help anyone approved by Mender, no questions asked.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T19:06:20.693000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870381752441536553","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Then we should all be up to speed so far.\"\nRoy writes a note.\n```\nSabrine and Ed caught up on the situation.\nWe'll start preparing for the Cup.\nWe'll see if lamplighters can help with the task.\n-- Roy\n```","created_at":"2021-07-29T19:06:53.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870381891247829052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
