{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"So, where should we start. Bones visited us at the Voice today, and noted that the Violet individual broke past the magic defenses he set up and took some of her equipment from the Cup. We're not sure if she'd have anything left to get. If not, that would leave, for now, just the mothman and the... whatever the other thing was as things to immediately deal with.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:33:16.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870720717128355871","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
