{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"We've started looking into things that would prevent what others experienced there, with being put to sleep by something. Sab found a potion store over in Feytown that can provide some potion to prevent magic sleep. Could there be anything else we might need to be ready for, that would put people to sleep, and not count as that?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:35:06.616000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870721180364070922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
