{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"860165485579337779","content":"\"Problematic, but better to know about it than not. Bones has some magical traps he can lay too, but then there's still the matter of how to deal with the creatures. Some other people over at Voice are investigating Violet's case in the meantime, so even if she completely abandons the Cup, we might still have a way to find her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:42:03.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870722928768065566","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
